    "intro_narrative": "You awaken to the blaring sirens of Orbital Station Aegis-7. Red emergency lights bathe the central command deck in an eerie glow. The station's central antimatter reactor is suffering a cascading failure, and you have less than an hour before the entire sector is vaporized. Your only way out is the emergency escape pod, but the automated lockdown protocols have sealed the launch bay tightly. To override the heavy blast doors, you must reboot the station's deeply encrypted systems and execute a manual override. The command deck is littered with specialized diagnostic equipment left behind by the engineering crew, each component relying on fragmented data from another. You'll need to carefully trace the data flow, decrypting the navigation pathways and stabilizing the energy modulators to bypass the security matrix. The cold vacuum of space waits just outside the reinforced glass, and your oxygen reserves are rapidly dropping. Find the correct sequence, process the encrypted data streams, and activate the Mainframe Core before Aegis-7 becomes your metallic tomb.",
    "narrative_style": "sci_fi"
  },
